+
+Do not call for: listing requests — use mindmap_work_signoff_list. Do not call for: rejecting — use mindmap_work_signoff_reject.
+
+Quorum: once the number of distinct approvals reaches min_signoffs, the request is marked approved and the deferred transition is applied (status + signoff_state updated on the work item). If the item has already moved/rebased while the request was open, the request is superseded instead. Approvals are idempotent.
